# Home paths that must stay real directories rather than becoming one stow symlink, as
# path | reason, the path written relative to the home directory. The rule and the mechanism
# are in the repository root CLAUDE.md and in decisions/stow-folding.md, and this file is read
# by src/setup-stow-dotfiles.sh, which finds it by name and knows nothing about this module.
.config/herdr | herdr keeps its sockets, its logs, its session state and its plugin registration beside its config, so a fold sends every one of them into this checkout
